<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯バイブ.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\茅萱の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "5000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―My head hurt...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The buzzing of the alarm was so loud.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why is my phone alarm even going off...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
College is still on spring break, isn't it?<PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
Then the alarm on my phone stopped by itself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haah, a little more sleep...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was a little hung over...<PG>
Just as I tried to go back to sleep, I realized the buzzing hadn't been the alarm but an incoming call.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I sluggishly reached for my phone.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\携帯茅萱入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
From <STYLE ID="1">Aunt Mifuyu</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What could she possibly want?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電話呼び出し.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "4000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Why, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Morning, morning!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "日曜日の朝.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Auntie's</STYLE> shrill voice, far more cheerful than it needed to be, hit my <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="さんはんきかん">inner ear</STYLE> head-on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was pretty rough on a hangover... I held the phone a little away from my ear.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, what is it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm in Tokyo on business today! I thought we might have lunch together!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I looked at the clock: 11 a.m.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My memory was hazy, but I'd probably gotten five hours of sleep.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I wanted to sleep a little longer, but I didn't feel right turning down an invitation from <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE> when she'd come all the way to Tokyo.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... Where should we meet?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, there's a cafe called 'Primavera' near your place. Do you know it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... I think there is one. That place, maybe...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then I'll be there a little after 12!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... All right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Auntie's</STYLE> voice the moment I woke up, and a meal with <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE> on top of that: my stomach already felt heavy.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1,000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\蛇口.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\シャワー.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\シャワー.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I let a shower pour over my head, as hot as I could just barely stand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd have liked a long soak in the tub, but there was no time to fill it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And I looked back on last night.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Last night... 
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\宴会.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
we'd gathered at 7 p.m. at a party bar for students.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Through a friend's introduction, I'd been let in on a drinking party with a tennis club of 30 or so.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The ratio of men to women was a perfect one to one, and every guy there was quite the clean-cut type.<PG>
My losing streak has hit triple digits.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All right, all right... today I'm going to catch at least one gentleman I can stay in touch with!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Putting on my good-girl act, I made my approach, making full use of the looks I'd inherited from <STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE>.<PG>
But gradually the guys got into the college mood and grew rowdy with chugging and drinking chants.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I see that kind of thing, my Arata settlement blood stirs.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if I'd lose to these city-bred beansprouts!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm a 100% natural mountain girl!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Even the guys who'd been fawning over me gradually began to stiffen their <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="ほお">cheek</STYLE> muscles at my wild streak.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That is irresistibly irresistible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't know how to put it, but it's irresistibly irresistible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After that I leave the rest to the alcohol, drag the men around until morning, and drink the night away.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\東京の夜明け.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And when I come to, sometimes I'm asleep in my own bed like today, and sometimes I'm asleep in a roadside gutter.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Last summer I even found myself floating in the middle of the <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="すみだがわ">Sumida River</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Anyone other than me would definitely have died.<PG>
The one thing I never get used to is the moment this morning arrives.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When morning comes, I'm hit by fierce self-loathing and regret.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I kept up my good-girl act the way I started, one or two of the men would probably see me as a woman.<PG>
But partway through I start having fun, and fooling around with everyone suits me better than sneaking out of the party with a guy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's what I think at the time, but come morning it's always like this.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\シャワー.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\シャワー.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Because of all this, not one man so far has even asked me out a second time, let alone pushed me down.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Truly, not a single one.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The most physical contact I've had with the opposite sex was probably putting a certain man in a figure-four leglock during the King Game.<PG>
Just to be clear, my face shouldn't be all that bad.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I take care of my figure, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At this point, I'm almost tempted to suspect the men just have no eye for women.<PG>
Well, I'm getting to see <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE>, after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She can at least listen to me grumble.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "256" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\蛇口.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I threw on whatever clothes, dried my hair any old way, and ran a comb through it any old way.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then, after brushing my teeth and nothing else, I left home.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As for makeup, I probably haven't put any on since Coming-of-Age Day.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\喫茶店外観.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The place <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE> had picked was a cafe I walked past almost every day but had never once gone into.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It looked very expensive.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I go to red-lantern bars a lot more than places like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I'm going to polish myself as a woman, maybe I ought to know places like this too...<PG>
Just in case, I checked what was in my wallet once more.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE> would probably treat me, but I didn't want to be the kind of woman who always expected that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yes, this was where polishing myself as a woman began.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just then, I felt a hand land on my shoulder with a pat.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n-660\r\n2000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n-660\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬腰に手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Long time no see, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you seem as full of energy as ever today."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It had been about three and a half months since I'd last seen <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not since we met in Arata this past New Year's.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh my!? </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, did you stay up late, by any chance? You look sleepy, and you've got dark circles under your eyes!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? Um..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Being young is no excuse to be so mean to your skin and your insides!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　They say aging starts in your teens!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hearing <STYLE ID="1">Auntie's</STYLE> shrill voice in person was rough on a hangover, as I'd thought...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sei_ge_cowbell01.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\喫茶店中2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Inside, fine ladies with an unmistakably wealthy air were enjoying their lunch.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This place must be expensive after all...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬腰に手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Come on, come on, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! Order whatever you like! Everything at this place is delicious!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, have you been here before?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Their main shop is in Motoki-cho! Back in the day, I used to go there with </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> all the time!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you wouldn't know her! She's been my best friend since the day I was born!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　She still lives in the apartment next door!"</STYLE><PG>
Come to think of it, I'd heard from <STYLE ID="8">Haruka</STYLE> that her <STYLE ID="9">best friend since birth</STYLE> lived next door.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could it be that two generations, parent and child, have built that kind of friendship?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's nobody around my age in the Arata settlement, so I'm a little jealous...<PG>
"Welcome, <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-sama</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
We hear you are a valued patron of our Motoki-cho main branch. 
{PAUSE ""}
Please, take your time and relax."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A young, pretty waitress greeted us <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="うやうや">respectfully</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I looked over the menu the waitress handed me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ugh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even with <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE> saying she'll treat me, there's one more zero than I imagined.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Canned coffee sells for 100 yen or so, and even the cheapest thing here is more than 10 times that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The lunch menu costs about as much as the first round of a drinking party.<PG>
Whoa... this one with the cakes and sandwiches stacked into a tower costs 5,000 yen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whoa, whoa...!! This even more amazing tower one is 9,000 yen...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something cheaper is fine!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This... the 3,000-yen beef curry set will do.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Though 3,000 yen for curry is pretty steep, too...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you don't have to hold back!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Relatives only treat you while you're a student!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I know there isn't the slightest ulterior motive in <STYLE ID="1">Auntie's</STYLE> urging.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I was thrown by a world where that much money changed hands for bread and curry, not even a kaiseki course.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A cold sweat trickled down me on its own.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, let's get this! One of these is enough for two!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE> pointed without hesitation at the giant tower one.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"O-okay..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if it was for two, that was 4,500 yen a head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently you could order any drink you liked, with refills.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But for 4,500 yen, I could get all-you-can-drink at the ryotei-style izakaya I went to last month.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As long as I'm thinking things like that, my girliness is at middle-aged-man level.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, don't you go to places like this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... I've hardly ever been to one..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, really? I'd think a beauty like </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you, Chigaya-chan,</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> would look right at home in a place like this!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... Would I suit it...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"But maybe you still prefer the Arata way of having fun?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Red-lantern bars, places with all-you-can-drink."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE> had seen right through me.
